  "limitations": [
    "Small integration fixtures; no SWE-Bench/GSM8K quality or throughput claim.",
    "Separate async used two GPUs on one physical host; dedicated physical sandbox nodes and multi-node RDMA were not exercised.",
    "Host NTP sync flag was 0. Single-host validation used clock.require_sync=false; scrape-relative offsets were checked. This is not proof of inter-node synchronization.",
    "Policy version lag and RDMA signals were unavailable and remained missing evidence.",
    "3FS KV offload, Terminal-Bench, full profiling and overload-induced storage diagnoses were not exercised in this matrix.",
    "Docker parent cgroup metrics aggregate the graders plus a tiny container holding the parent alive; no per-trajectory resource attribution.",
    "Async trainer-update windows do not enclose every rollout/tool span; exact spans were inspected in their own trace windows."
  ],
